<title>DUBAI: United Arab Bank raises net, issues bonus shares.</title>
<headline>United Arab Bank raises net, issues bonus shares.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (million UAE dirhams unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit		 25.70	  vs     20.80</p>
<p> Net operating income   73.71	  vs     70.10</p>
<p> Net interest income    50.93	  vs     48.38</p>
<p> Other income	     22.77	  vs     21.72</p>
<p> Cash dividend	     7.44	  vs     10.41</p>
<p>Full Name: United Arab Bank</p>
<p>Note - The bank, based in the UAE emirate of Sharjah, is 20 percent owned by Societe General. The bank will distribute five percent bonus shares worth 7.44 million dirhams, as well as the cash dividend. -- Dubai newsroom  9714-626990</p>
</text>
